    <node id="7ba49868-f95b-4674-b6e5-4836961fc00d">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Whole Life Insurance Policy Details","text":"╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║           WHOLE LIFE INSURANCE POLICY                             ║\n║           Guardian Family Protection Corp.                        ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nPolicy No: GFP-WL-2024-8847\nEffective Date: February 1, 2024\nPolicy Type: Participating Whole Life\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1. INSURED INFORMATION\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nName: Margaret Rose Chen\nDOB: July 8, 1978\nIssue Age: 45\nRisk Class: Standard Non-Tobacco\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n2. COVERAGE SUMMARY\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nFace Amount: $250,000\nAnnual Premium: $3,240\nPayment Frequency: Annual\nPremium Payment Period: To age 100\nMaturity Date: Age 100 (July 8, 2078)\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n3. BENEFICIARIES\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nPrimary: David Chen (Husband) - 100%\nContingent: Chen Family Trust - 100%\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n4. KEY DEFINITIONS\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\"Cash Surrender Value\" - The amount available if the policy is \nsurrendered, equal to the cash value minus any outstanding loans \nand surrender charges.\n\n\"Dividend\" - A return of premium that may be declared annually \nby the Board of Directors based on company experience.\n\n\"Paid-Up Insurance\" - A reduced death benefit with no further \npremiums required.\n\n\"Policy Loan\" - A loan made by us using the cash value as collateral.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5. CASH VALUE ACCUMULATION\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5.1 This policy","summary":"This is a participating whole life insurance policy issued to Margaret Rose Chen with a face amount of $250,000, an annual premium of $3,240, and coverage until age 100. The primary beneficiary is her husband, David Chen, with a contingent beneficiary being the Chen Family Trust. Key features include dividend eligibility, cash surrender value, policy loans, and options for converting to paid-up insurance.","topics":["Life Insurance","Financial Planning","Estate Protection","Insurance Policy"],"facts":[{"name":"Issuance of Participating Policy","sentence":"Guardian Family Protection Corp. issued a participating whole life insurance policy.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["participating whole life","policy issuance","insurer identification"],"entities":[{"name":"Guardian Family Protection Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"WHOLE LIFE INSURANCE POLICY","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance product offered","relational_anchors":["GFP-WL-2024-8847"]},{"name":"GFP-WL-2024-8847","type":"NUMBER","role":"unique policy identifier","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"February 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Margaret Rose Chen","type":"PERSON","role":"insured individual","relational_anchors":["DOB: July 8, 1978","Issue Age: 45"]},{"name":"David Chen","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Chen Family Trust","type":"ENTITY","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$250,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of coverage","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$3,240","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual premium amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"July 8, 2078","type":"DATE","role":"maturity date of policy","relational_anchors":["Age 100"]},{"name":"Cash Surrender Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"value upon policy surrender","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Dividend","type":"CONCEPT","role":"return of premium declaration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Paid-Up Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"reduced benefit without premiums","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Loan","type":"CONCEPT","role":"loan against cash value","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Policy Identification Number","sentence":"The policy number is GFP-WL-2024-8847.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy number","insurance identification","document reference"],"entities":[{"name":"Guardian Family Protection Corp.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"WHOLE LIFE INSURANCE POLICY","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance product offered","relational_anchors":["GFP-WL-2024-8847"]},{"name":"GFP-WL-2024-8847","type":"NUMBER","role":"unique policy identifier","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"February 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Margaret Rose Chen","type":"PERSON","role":"insured individual","relational_anchors":["DOB: July 8, 1978","Issue Age: 45"]},{"name":"David Chen","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Chen Family Trust","type":"ENTITY","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$250,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of coverage","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$3,240","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual premium amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"July 8, 2078","type":"DATE","role":"maturity date of policy","relational_anchors":["Age 100"]},{"name":"Cash Surrender Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"value upon policy surrender","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Dividend","type":"CONCEPT","role":"return of premium declaration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Paid-Up Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"reduced benefit without premiums","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Loan","type":"CONCEPT","role":"loan against cash value","relational