    <node id="4b9c8a85-179d-4db7-b2f9-76f7f762c9a9">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Life Insurance Cash Value &amp; Loan Features","text":"\" - A loan made by us using the cash value as collateral.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5. CASH VALUE ACCUMULATION\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5.1 This policy builds cash value according to the guaranteed \n    schedule shown in the policy values table.\n\n5.2 Cash value grows on a tax-deferred basis.\n\n5.3 Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 10: $28,450\n    Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 20: $71,200\n\n5.4 Actual cash value may be higher due to dividend credits.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n6. POLICY DIVIDENDS\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n6.1 This is a participating policy. Annual dividends may be \n    declared based on our mortality, investment, and expense \n    experience.\n\n6.2 Dividends are not guaranteed.\n\n6.3 DIVIDEND OPTIONS (select one):\n    ✓ Cash Payment - Dividend paid directly to you\n    □ Premium Reduction - Applied to reduce next premium\n    □ Accumulate at Interest - Left with us to accumulate\n    □ Paid-Up Additions - Purchase additional insurance\n    [Current selection: Paid-Up Additions]\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n7. POLICY LOANS\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n7.1 You may borrow against the cash value after the policy has \n    been in force for one full year.\n\n7.2 Maximum loan amount: 90% of current cash surrender value.\n\n7.3 Loan interest rate: 5% per annum, compounded annually.\n\n7.4 Interest may be paid annually or added to the loan balance.\n\n7.5 If total indebtedness exceeds the cash value, the policy \n    will terminate unless sufficient payment is made within \n    31 days of notice.\n\n7.6 Outstanding loans and accrued interest will be deducted \n    from the death benefit or cash surrender value.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n8. DEATH BENEFIT PAYMENT\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n8.1 Upon receipt of proof of death, we will pay the beneficiary:\n    Face Amount + Paid-Up Additions - Policy Loans - Loan Interest\n\n8.2","summary":"This life insurance policy accumulates cash value according to a guaranteed schedule, growing tax-deferred with projected values of $28,450 at Year 10 and $71,200 at Year 20. It is a participating policy offering non-guaranteed annual dividends, currently allocated toward paid-up additions. Policyholders can borrow up to 90% of their cash surrender value after one year, subject to a 5% annual compound interest rate; unpaid balances reduce the death benefit or cash surrender value. The final death benefit equals face amount plus paid-up additions minus any outstanding loans and accrued interest.","topics":["Cash Value Accumulation","Policy Loans","Dividends","Death Benefit"],"facts":[{"name":"Guaranteed Cash Value Growth","sentence":"This policy builds cash value according to the guaranteed schedule shown in the policy values table.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Cash Value Accumulation","Guaranteed Schedule","Policy Values Table"],"entities":[{"name":"cash value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"collateral for loan","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 10: $28,450","Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 20: $71,200"]},{"name":"tax-deferred basis","type":"CONCEPT","role":"growth mechanism for cash value","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"end of Year 10","type":"DATE","role":"timing point for guaranteed cash value","relational_anchors":["$28,450"]},{"name":"end of Year 20","type":"DATE","role":"timing point for guaranteed cash value","relational_anchors":["$71,200"]},{"name":"dividend credits","type":"CONCEPT","role":"factor increasing actual cash value","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"participating policy","type":"CONCEPT","role":"eligibility condition for dividends","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"annual dividends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-guaranteed income stream","relational_anchors":["based on mortality, investment, and expense experience"]},{"name":"Paid-Up Additions","type":"OPTION","role":"selected dividend option","relational_anchors":["[Current selection: Paid-Up Additions]"]},{"name":"policy loan","type":"CONCEPT","role":"borrowing right against cash value","relational_anchors":["after the policy has been in force for one full year","Maximum loan amount: 90% of current cash surrender value","Loan interest rate: 5% per annum, compounded annually"]},{"name":"5%","type":"RATE","role":"loan interest rate","relational_anchors":["per annum, compounded annually"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period before termination","relational_anchors":["within 31 days of notice"]},{"name":"total indebtedness","type":"CONCEPT","role":"threshold triggering policy termination","relational_anchors":["exceeds the cash value"]},{"name":"death benefit payment","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout calculation upon death","relational_anchors":["Face Amount + Paid-Up Additions - Policy Loans - Loan Interest"]}]},{"name":"Tax-Deferred Growth","sentence":"Cash value grows on a tax-deferred basis.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["tax-deferred growth","cash value accumulation","policy dividends"],"entities":[{"name":"cash value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"collateral for loan","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 10: $28,450","Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 20: $71,200"]},{"name":"tax-deferred basis","type":"CONCEPT","role":"growth mechanism for cash value","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"end of Year 10","type":"DATE","role":"timing point for guaranteed cash value","relational_anchors":["$28,450"]},{"name":"end of Year 20","type":"DATE","role":"timing point for guaranteed cash value","relational_anchors":["$71,200"]},{"name":"dividend credits","type":"CONCEPT","role":"factor increasing actual cash value","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"participating policy","type":"CONCEPT","role":"eligibility condition for dividends","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"annual dividends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-guaranteed income stream","relational_anchors":["based on mortality, investment, and expense experience"]},{"name":"Paid-Up Additions","type":"OPTION","role":"selected dividend option","relational_anchors":["[Current selection: Paid-Up Additions]"]},{"name":"policy loan","type":"CONCEPT","role":"borrowing right against cash value","relational_anchors":["after the policy has been in force for one full year","Maximum loan amount: 90% of current cash surrender value","Loan interest rate: 5% per annum, compounded annually"]},{"name":"5%","type":"RATE","role":"loan interest rate","relational_anchors":["per annum, compounded annually"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period before termination","relational_anchors":["within 31 days of notice"]},{"name":"total indebtedness","type":"CONCEPT","role":"threshold triggering policy termination","relational_anchors":["exceeds the cash value"]},{"name":"death benefit payment","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout calculation upon death","relational_anchors":["Face Amount + Paid-Up Additions - Policy Loans - Loan Interest"]}]},{"name":"Guaranteed Cash Value at Year 10","sentence":"Guaranteed cash value at the end of Year 10 is $28,450.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Cash Value Accumulation","Year 10 Guarantee","Policy Growth Schedule"],"entities":[{"name":"cash value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"collateral for loan","relational_anchors":["Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 10: $28,450","Guaranteed cash value at end of Year 20: $71,200"]},{"name":"tax-deferred basis","type":"CONCEPT","role":"growth mechanism for cash value","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"end of Year 10","type":"DATE","role":"timing point for guaranteed cash value","relational_anchors