    </node>
    <node id="1f26ee66-e01f-476a-821b-8c713468ee90">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Insurance Claim &amp; Policy Flexibility","text":"EFIT PAYMENT\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n8.1 Upon receipt of proof of death, we will pay the beneficiary:\n    Face Amount + Paid-Up Additions - Policy Loans - Loan Interest\n\n8.2 Payment will be made within 7 days of receiving complete \n    claim documentation.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n9. NON-FORFEITURE OPTIONS\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nIf you stop paying premiums after the policy has been in force for \nthree years, you may elect:\n\n9.1 CASH SURRENDER: Receive the cash surrender value and \n    terminate the policy.\n\n9.2 REDUCED PAID-UP INSURANCE: Continue coverage for a reduced \n    death benefit with no further premiums required. Amount \n    based on cash value and insured's attained age.\n\n9.3 EXTENDED TERM INSURANCE: Continue the full face amount for \n    a limited period based on cash value. No further premiums.\n\n9.4 If no election is made within 60 days of lapse, Extended \n    Term Insurance will automatically apply.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n10. REINSTATEMENT\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n10.1 You may reinstate this policy within 3 years of lapse if:\n     (a) You provide evidence of insurability satisfactory to us\n     (b) You pay all overdue premiums with interest at 6% per annum\n     (c) You repay or reinstate any policy loans with interest\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n11. EXCLUSIONS AND LIMITATIONS\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n11.1 SUICIDE: If the insured dies by suicide within two years \n     from the issue date, we will pay only the premiums paid, \n     without interest.\n\n11.2 MISSTATEMENT OF AGE: If the insured's age was misstated, \n     we will adjust the face amount to what the premium would \n     have purchased at the correct age.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n12. FREE LOOK PERIOD\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nYou may cancel this policy within 30 days of receipt for a full \nrefund of premiums paid.\n\n────────────────────────────────────────","summary":"Upon proof of death, beneficiaries receive the face amount minus outstanding loans and interest. Claims are processed within seven days. If premiums stop after three years, policyholders can choose cash surrender, reduced paid-up insurance, extended term insurance, or default to extended term. Reinstatement is possible within three years if insurability is proven and past dues plus interest are paid. Suicide within two years limits payout to premiums paid; incorrect age results in adjusted benefits. A 30-day free look allows cancellation for a full refund.","topics":["Life Insurance Benefits","Policy Lapse Options","Reinstatement Terms","Claim Processing"],"facts":[{"name":"Death Benefit Calculation","sentence":"Upon receipt of proof of death, EFIT will pay the beneficiary the sum of the Face Amount plus Paid-Up Additions minus Policy Loans minus Loan Interest.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["death benefit","proof of death","policy loan deduction","paid-up additions"],"entities":[{"name":"Face Amount","type":"CONCEPT","role":"primary death benefit sum","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Paid-Up Additions","type":"CONCEPT","role":"additional benefits added to policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"outstanding borrowed amounts against policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Loan Interest","type":"CONCEPT","role":"interest accrued on unpaid policy loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 7 days","type":"DATE","role":"timeframe for claim processing","relational_anchors":["7 days"]},{"name":"Cash Surrender Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary value upon policy termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Reduced Paid-Up Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"continued coverage with lower death benefit","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Extended Term Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"full coverage continuation for limited term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 60 days of lapse","type":"DATE","role":"deadline for elective action post-lapse","relational_anchors":["60 days"]},{"name":"within 3 years of lapse","type":"DATE","role":"window for policy reinstatement eligibility","relational_anchors":["3 years"]},{"name":"Evidence of Insurability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"proof of health suitability for reinstatement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Overdue Premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"unpaid installments due upon reinstatement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Interest at 6% per annum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"rate applied to overdue payments","relational_anchors":["6%"]},{"name":"Suicide","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"event triggering restricted payout clause","relational_anchors":["two years from the issue date"]},{"name":"Misstatement of Age","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"error leading to adjusted death benefit","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Free Look Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace window for cancellation without penalty","relational_anchors":["30 days"]}]},{"name":"Claims Settlement Timeline","sentence":"Payment under Section 8.1 will be made within 7 days of receiving complete claim documentation.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["claims payment","settlement timeframe","claim documentation"],"entities":[{"name":"Face Amount","type":"CONCEPT","role":"primary death benefit sum","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Paid-Up Additions","type":"CONCEPT","role":"additional benefits added to policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"outstanding borrowed amounts against policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Loan Interest"