    <edge source="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b" target="aa7737fa-2c32-4ee2-8244-f4f6917dedc8">
      <data key="d3">Margaret Rose Chen is the insured individual under a participating whole life insurance policy issued by Guardian Family Protection Corp., linking her identity directly to the policy’s originator.</data>
      <data key="d4">insured under</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b" target="29b4269d-f2dc-4371-857c-c53041540b11">
      <data key="d3">Knowing the insured’s name allows verification of the correct policy holder, and the policy number serves as the unique reference point for accessing details about that specific policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">identified by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b" target="82aeed9b-92d1-465a-b1fa-fc66540d9d53">
      <data key="d3">Knowing the insured is Margaret Rose Chen establishes the subject of the policy, making it possible to interpret what kind of policy she holds, such as a participating whole life policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b" target="e1c25cef-f1a5-45b6-bce9-aecb6d7ba9a3">
      <data key="d3">Margaret Rose Chen is the insured under the policy, and the annual premium of $3,240 applies specifically to her coverage. This payment supports the maintenance of her policy benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b" target="696e047c-d749-4525-a7f2-29da3bb3dbc5">
      <data key="d3">Margaret Rose Chen is the person insured under the policy, making her the subject of coverage. This directly informs why David Chen, as her spouse, is designated as the primary beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b" target="f2b0d75b-5269-4ff2-968e-6b31adab60dd">
      <data key="d3">Margaret Rose Chen is the insured under the policy, and because she is the subject of the contract, any death benefit payout depends on her passing. As the primary beneficiary, David Chen is entitled to receive 100% of that payout upon her death.</data>
