    <edge source="e30d5ff9-c327-44ac-844c-18f5f947e1ea" target="aa7737fa-2c32-4ee2-8244-f4f6917dedc8">
      <data key="d3">The contingent beneficiary designation in fact_sentence_2 complements the information from fact_sentence_1 regarding the policy issuer, helping establish who benefits if the primary beneficiary predeceases the insured.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e30d5ff9-c327-44ac-844c-18f5f947e1ea" target="6798b2ae-9c41-40d4-a9ed-fcff5337565b">
      <data key="d3">The Chen Family Trust serves as the contingent beneficiary, implying its designation relies on Margaret Rose Chen being the insured person in the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e30d5ff9-c327-44ac-844c-18f5f947e1ea" target="696e047c-d749-4525-a7f2-29da3bb3dbc5">
      <data key="d3">The Chen Family Trust acts as a backup recipient when David Chen cannot claim the benefit, ensuring continuity of distribution according to Margaret's intent.</data>
      <data key="d4">primary alternative</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e30d5ff9-c327-44ac-844c-18f5f947e1ea" target="f2b0d75b-5269-4ff2-968e-6b31adab60dd">
      <data key="d3">The Chen Family Trust serves as the contingent beneficiary, receiving the death benefit only if David Chen is unable to inherit, such as due to prior death. This status depends on David's survival relative to Margaret.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e30d5ff9-c327-44ac-844c-18f5f947e1ea" target="cc4ee768-e80c-4370-82a3-99c192f12951">
      <data key="d3">The Chen Family Trust serves as the contingent beneficiary, meaning it inherits the entire death benefit only if the primary beneficiary passes away before the insured. This ensures continuity of benefits according to the policy's design.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional receipt</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e9187204-43db-48be-b4da-23d5efd7cef5" target="e30d5ff9-c327-44ac-844c-18f5f947e1ea">
