      <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 completes the lifecycle narrative by explaining how the accumulated cash value and death benefit are ultimately disbursed upon death, including adjustments for loans and other terms that affect payouts.</data>
      <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
