      <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 establishes the policy framework—including ownership, beneficiaries, and basic terms—that gives essential context for understanding the numerical projections and mechanisms described in this summary.</data>
      <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
