      <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 establishes critical early-stage protections—such as the right to cancel within 30 days and limited contestability—which validate the policy’s integrity and enhance trust in its long-term promises like cash buildup and death benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances trust</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
      <data key="d6">True</data>
