    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="fa553e56-e112-469f-8663-f933f16d9c29">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">concept</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="4c8f100a-adce-4460-bb69-fb1a0bd38aba">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">concept</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="9986f495-b32e-416c-9bee-9bd3fcfd38f1">
      <data key="d3">Tax deferral enables the cash value to grow more effectively under the guaranteed schedule outlined in the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="8a5bb177-c6ec-43a8-ab9b-8642558f8120">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of the cash value enables it to accumulate steadily over time, leading to the specified guaranteed value of $71,200 by Year 20.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="4db504ec-839d-45cc-a54e-508072f29052">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of the cash value supports its ability to reach the guaranteed amount of $28,450 by Year 10, reflecting long-term compounding without immediate taxation.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="84a7b196-2336-4dd5-8ec6-5834754c1add">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth allows the cash value to increase over time without immediate taxation, enabling dividend credits to accumulate more effectively by compounding within the account.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="982dcffc-8963-4a09-a00a-3a7afc345757">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value enables the accumulation of funds that serve as collateral for policy loans. This growth supports the calculation of the maximum allowable loan amount, which is tied to the current cash surrender value.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="e3e246c1-096d-44df-8e6e-335cc7374485">
      <data key="d3">Tax-deferred growth enables the cash value to increase without immediate taxation, allowing paid-up additions to accumulate more effectively within the policy. This compounding effect enhances long-term value creation under the policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="39a1ab26-48c9-45c8-bbe9-0682552a3e65">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value enables long-term compounding, creating favorable conditions under which dividends can be effectively reinvested via paid-up additions to boost future policy value.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="e4e45c14-e67b-4e30-b13b-2739562070cd">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value enables its use as loan collateral, setting the stage for future reductions in the death benefit when loans remain unpaid.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="9385aac2-9570-4e2e-8922-87d7cad0451d">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value enables it to increase over time, forming the foundation upon which loan balances are compared. When borrowed amounts exceed this growing cash value, the policy faces termination due to insolvency risk.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value enables future borrowing capacity, making it possible for loan deductions to impact the cash surrender value.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="0e45bbad-ae20-4562-bed9-67e55a13cadc">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value allows the policy’s accumulated value—including paid-up additions—to increase over time, forming the basis for calculating the final death benefit when claims are processed.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value enables borrowers to access funds via loans, upon which interest can accumulate if unpaid.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="62ce7dc7-8d45-41ca-8622-42a08799f32e">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value allows it to accumulate over time, making it possible for policyholders to access funds through loans once sufficient value has been built up.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc" target="20487c89-e0e7-4387-abc3-4e1f3259ca1f">
      <data key="d3">The tax-deferred growth of cash value provides a foundation for long-term wealth accumulation, enhanced when dividends are reinvested through options like "Accumulate at Interest."</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
