      <data key="d3">A cash payment dividend option exists because the policy is participating, enabling the insurer to distribute surplus earnings to policyholders.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
