      <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies a method for handling dividends: paying them out in cash to the policyholder. This choice depends on whether dividends have been declared, which is governed by factors like mortality experience mentioned in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">option for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
