      <data key="d3">The availability of a Cash Payment dividend option implies that dividends are not automatic but depend on the insurer’s investment outcomes each year.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
