      <data key="d3">Accrued interest on policy loans diminishes the effective cash surrender value and offsets gains from the guaranteed cash value buildup, reducing overall policy strength unless managed carefully.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc">
      <data key="d3">Unpaid loan interest adds to the debt burden, reducing available cash value that otherwise would grow tax-deferred.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="8a5bb177-c6ec-43a8-ab9b-8642558f8120">
      <data key="d3">Accrued interest on policy loans reduces the effective cash surrender value over time, potentially lowering the realized cash value compared to the guaranteed figure by Year 20.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="760d34d4-eb2d-414c-baa9-b87b4f1a8e93">
      <data key="d3">Accumulating interest on policy loans reflects a consequence of the policy being participatory, allowing borrowers to leverage built-up cash value while exposing them to increasing liabilities.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="62ce7dc7-8d45-41ca-8622-42a08799f32e">
      <data key="d3">The ability to have interest added to a loan balance depends on having already accessed the cash value through a policy loan, which requires the policy to be active for at least one year.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="982dcffc-8963-4a09-a00a-3a7afc345757">
      <data key="d3">Accrued interest increases the total loan burden, directly impacting the borrower’s equity and reducing available benefits unless managed through repayment.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces equity</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="3aa4a1e9-a805-4aee-a558-83457fd0e547">
      <data key="d3">A loan's interest accumulating onto the principal requires an established interest rate, such as the 5% annually specified here.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="528ac7df-43ef-4675-962b-37d25d763e12">
      <data key="d3">When interest is added to the loan balance, it contributes to the growth of the outstanding loan amount through compounding, reinforcing the effect described by annual compounding.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="c0cc74e7-542a-4528-ba0d-09bdfde98f5d">
      <data key="d3">Adding interest to the loan balance allows borrowers to defer annual payments, though this increases future repayment obligations.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="9385aac2-9570-4e2e-8922-87d7cad0451d">
      <data key="d3">When interest on a policy loan is not repaid, it adds to the loan balance, increasing overall indebtedness. If this accumulation surpasses the policy’s cash value, the policy terminates.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef">
      <data key="d3">When interest accrues on a policy loan, it increases the total loan balance, leading to greater deductions from the cash surrender value if the loan remains unpaid.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="0e45bbad-ae20-4562-bed9-67e55a13cadc">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest compounds and adds to the outstanding loan balance, increasing the total debt owed. This increased loan balance reduces the final death benefit when claims are processed.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="e4e45c14-e67b-4e30-b13b-2739562070cd">
      <data key="d3">When interest accrues on an unpaid policy loan, it increases the total loan balance, thereby increasing the amount that will ultimately be deducted from the death benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">increases debt</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0" target="676d3ef5-d991-4b39-a33e-ea3ec7cfb545">
      <data key="d3">Accrued interest increases the total loan balance, potentially making it harder to repay the loan within the grace period. This raises the risk that the policyholder cannot satisfy the required payment, leading to termination if unresolved within 31 days.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f29173bd-e143-4541-878d-393b7e9e5055" target="d5989a8e-5059-4901-af97-50fb73edccc0">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by interest accrual on policy loan</data>
    </edge>
