    </edge>
    <edge source="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef" target="9986f495-b32e-416c-9bee-9bd3fcfd38f1">
      <data key="d3">Since the policy allows borrowing against the cash surrender value, the presence of such a value—built via the guaranteed schedule—is necessary for the deduction of outstanding loans and interest to apply.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef" target="f0d953de-57de-4009-9c3c-a624848400bc">
      <data key="d3">Deductions due to outstanding loans and interest rely on the presence of accumulated cash value, which results from tax-deferred growth.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef" target="4db504ec-839d-45cc-a54e-508072f29052">
      <data key="d3">Deductions from the cash surrender value due to loans and interest diminish the total funds available, potentially affecting whether the full guaranteed value is realized upon withdrawal or surrender.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef" target="8a5bb177-c6ec-43a8-ab9b-8642558f8120">
      <data key="d3">Any outstanding loans and accrued interest diminish the effective cash surrender value, meaning the reported guaranteed cash value of $71,200 might not reflect the net amount available due to such reductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef" target="84a7b196-2336-4dd5-8ec6-5834754c1add">
      <data key="d3">Outstanding loans and accrued interest diminish the cash surrender value, meaning even if dividends boost the value, such gains may be offset by debt obligations.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
