      <data key="d3">The deduction of loans and accrued interest reduces the cash surrender value, thereby diminishing the pool of assets that might otherwise absorb future dividend allocations or increase overall policy value.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces potential value from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
