    <edge source="6025efda-5892-4057-8c1a-24a08309d3ef" target="13b1ef68-ef2d-411e-9021-06ccea514adb">
      <data key="d3">The deduction of outstanding loans and accrued interest reduces the cash surrender value, potentially diminishing the benefits derived from non-guaranteed dividends if those dividends were used to increase the policy’s value.</data>
