      <data key="d3">The death benefit computation includes paid-up additions derived from dividends—features enabled by the policy’s participating nature—but the payment mechanism itself doesn’t require active participation beyond those allocations.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
