      <data key="d3">The death benefit calculation includes deductions for unpaid loan interest, which is explicitly set at 5% annually, making the interest rate a foundational component of the payout adjustment.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for payout</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
