    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="4efbedc6-1cfd-4358-ac83-80bd56506e46">
      <data key="d3">The insurer processes and pays out the pre-determined death benefit amount within seven days of receiving proper documentation.</data>
      <data key="d4">follows</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="0c1d3d36-ecf7-4afe-973c-5c905fcb9ec8">
      <data key="d3">The prompt to process claims within seven days supports timely delivery of benefits, including those associated with reduced paid-up insurance, ensuring beneficiaries receive adjusted coverage amounts efficiently.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="d9857520-5a18-4a32-8752-3f61f66f696a">
      <data key="d3">Claim payments are issued within seven days upon receipt of complete documents, enabling swift initiation of alternative coverages like extended term insurance, which requires no future premiums.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4">
      <data key="d3">The timing of claim payments depends on accurate benefit calculations, including adjustments due to misstated ages. This ensures that payouts reflect corrected terms based on actual eligibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="4871bb62-321f-47dd-8890-1d5bf5de7bcf">
      <data key="d3">Claim payments occur within seven days of receiving documents, unless restricted by exceptions such as suicide within two years, which caps the payout at premiums paid.</data>
      <data key="d4">exception to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="07e5a874-62e0-4196-a2d8-9165fd8a7041">
      <data key="d3">While fact_sentence_2 discusses post-death payouts involving loan reductions, it indirectly supports the calculation logic used in fact_sentence_1 by confirming that loans reduce final payments regardless of whether the trigger is surrender or death.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08" target="310584c0-76a7-4455-8d4e-410439b625ea">
      <data key="d3">Timely claim disbursement ensures that the financial outcome of choosing paid-up insurance is realized efficiently, validating its role as a stable post-premium option.</data>
      <data key="d4">triggers outcome</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f41c9480-a6a9-473d-98a7-ca31021e9e80" target="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08">
