    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="9054f79e-c024-42c1-ab31-f6a85012ac7b">
      <data key="d3">The ability to receive the cash surrender value and terminate the policy is made available through the non-forfeiture option chosen when premiums are discontinued after three years.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="0c1d3d36-ecf7-4afe-973c-5c905fcb9ec8">
      <data key="d3">Cash Surrender ends the policy and pays out its accumulated cash value, offering immediate liquidity but terminating protection. Reduced Paid-Up Insurance preserves some life insurance coverage at a lower death benefit using the existing cash value, eliminating future premium obligations.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="b13a632f-d54c-467f-9a7f-83f5e5c712e6">
      <data key="d3">Cash Surrender provides immediate access to the policy’s cash value upon cessation of premiums, while Reduced Paid-Up Insurance offers continued coverage without further payment using accumulated cash value. Both are non-forfeiture options triggered by lapsing premiums after three years.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="63ff27ef-e3e0-4f42-bbe9-ee3129a67647">
      <data key="d3">Cash Surrender provides immediate liquidity by terminating the policy for its accumulated value, whereas Extended Term Insurance extends coverage without further payments. Both are non-forfeiture options triggered when premiums stop after three years.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="d9857520-5a18-4a32-8752-3f61f66f696a">
      <data key="d3">Cash Surrender terminates the policy and pays out the cash value, while Extended Term Insurance continues coverage without requiring additional premiums. Both are alternatives offered upon cessation of premium payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="8b98c6ac-7eb3-4170-b9c4-eba31a5b67b4">
      <data key="d3">Cash surrender involves receiving the accumulated cash value to end the policy, which directly informs the basis for calculating reduced paid-up insurance amounts that use the same cash value component along with the insured’s attained age.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="10bf0615-4e53-4ca9-9f8f-24f248922077">
      <data key="d3">Cash surrender terminates the policy and pays out the cash value, whereas extended term uses that same cash value to continue coverage at the original face amount for a time-limited duration.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="f96958f0-bbcb-476e-be0c-004fac2bd620">
      <data key="d3">Cash surrender is a voluntary termination option that ends coverage and pays out the cash value. If not chosen within 60 days of lapse, the policy defaults to extended term insurance.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71">
      <data key="d3">Cash surrender terminates the policy permanently by paying out the accumulated cash value. This contrasts with reinstatement, which aims to revive a lapsed policy rather than end it.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="1aca0368-1bec-44f3-997c-933cfa6b6cff">
      <data key="d3">Cash surrender terminates the policy and pays out the cash value, potentially affecting whether unpaid loans remain. Reinstatement may require repaying those same loans, so prior surrender could prevent future reinstatement due to unresolved debt.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="310584c0-76a7-4455-8d4e-410439b625ea">
      <data key="d3">Cash surrender provides a lump-sum payout upon policy termination, whereas paid-up insurance maintains a lower death benefit indefinitely without additional premiums.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923" target="07e5a874-62e0-4196-a2d8-9165fd8a7041">
      <data key="d3">The ability to exercise cash surrender hinges entirely on knowing how the cash surrender value is calculated, making it dependent on the details outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c5ec97f5-183d-408a-ba79-b8d583189c3c" target="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">influences policy value</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c649f49a-2188-42c7-8905-f3d841eaccd2" target="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">increases cash surrender value</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a33a6e19-a6ff-439f-9549-39684c9b4494" target="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces cash surrender value</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="429e6a16-9191-4484-8cc6-b651e236480d" target="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">increases liability reducing cash surrender value</data>
    </edge>
