    <edge source="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71" target="747cc78d-f00a-40a8-979b-9890c223d923">
      <data key="d3">Reinstating a policy requires proving insurability and settling overdue amounts, offering a recovery path that differs from cash surrender, where the policy ends entirely.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71" target="0c1d3d36-ecf7-4afe-973c-5c905fcb9ec8">
      <data key="d3">Reinstatement enables revival of a lapsed policy by demonstrating insurability and settling arrears, offering an alternative path that bypasses reduced paid-up insurance.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71" target="777d5357-97c8-4051-86e0-1ca68438a2f4">
      <data key="d3">If a policyholder seeks to reinstate a lapsed policy within three years, they must prove insurability. This eligibility condition is contingent upon paying all overdue premiums along with interest at 6% per annum.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71" target="1aca0368-1bec-44f3-997c-933cfa6b6cff">
      <data key="d3">If a policyholder seeks to reinstate a lapsed policy within three years, they must prove insurability. This includes repaying any outstanding policy loans along with accrued interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71" target="310584c0-76a7-4455-8d4e-410439b625ea">
      <data key="d3">Reinstatement requires meeting insurer criteria like insurability, which contrasts with paid-up insurance that automatically activates without such conditions once triggered.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71" target="07e5a874-62e0-4196-a2d8-9165fd8a7041">
      <data key="d3">Reinstatement requires payment of overdue amounts and proof of insurability, which could affect whether a surrendered policy’s cash value remains accessible, though it does not alter the formula used to calculate it.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="eb64e04d-0df1-4e91-89b7-68cb082f18d7" target="b3ac5002-b47d-45fd-8c6f-813289686f71">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is the time limit for policy reinstatement</data>
    </edge>
