    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="4efbedc6-1cfd-4358-ac83-80bd56506e46">
      <data key="d3">An incorrectly stated age leads to an adjusted face amount, which becomes the basis for calculating the final benefit paid out per fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="5ea73efa-2572-4665-a567-0bc08cfeff08">
      <data key="d3">Adjustments to the face amount because of an incorrect age affect the final payment amount, which is then issued within seven days once documentation is received.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="8b98c6ac-7eb3-4170-b9c4-eba31a5b67b4">
      <data key="d3">An inaccurate age statement triggers a recalculation of the face amount so it matches the coverage obtainable at the true age. This process inherently uses the same principles applied in calculating reduced paid-up insurance, particularly reliance on attained age and available cash value.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="63ff27ef-e3e0-4f42-bbe9-ee3129a67647">
      <data key="d3">The adjustment of the extended term insurance face amount due to an inaccurate age ensures fair treatment. This correction applies specifically when the policyholder chooses extended term insurance after stopping premiums post-three-year mark.</data>
      <data key="d4">explains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="10bf0615-4e53-4ca9-9f8f-24f248922077">
      <data key="d3">The face amount of extended term insurance is subject to adjustment when the insured’s age was misrepresented, meaning the coverage level depends on correcting the initial error before determining actual protection duration.</data>
      <data key="d4">caused by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="f96958f0-bbcb-476e-be0c-004fac2bd620">
      <data key="d3">Incorrectly reported age triggers adjustments in the Extended Term Insurance benefit to align with actual premium costs. This adjustment only occurs if EFIT has already been applied due to lack of timely election post-lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies outcome</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="d9857520-5a18-4a32-8752-3f61f66f696a">
      <data key="d3">The adjustment of the face amount due to an incorrect age directly affects the terms of extended term insurance, where no future premiums are needed, making accuracy critical to benefit calculation.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4" target="310584c0-76a7-4455-8d4e-410439b625ea">
      <data key="d3">Misstatement of age leads to recalculated benefits, potentially resulting in a reduced paid-up insurance option instead of the original face amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e3bba413-e312-4149-b08e-66e3c83233ad" target="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">adjusted due to age misstatement</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f9caed65-8cae-475b-bae8-5567231545b4" target="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is a potential result of adjustment</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="2d61aba2-6d24-4143-892b-8dcf17d1fb0d" target="fdebe47d-6d0f-4dce-a65b-cbc219fc28d4">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is a potential result of adjustment</data>
    </edge>
