    <edge source="0f2cfa5e-fb62-4758-8fe0-1102a3d97086" target="c580619d-07d0-45d8-b554-365e608170c8">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes the 30-day cancellation option with a full refund, which is confirmed and contextualized by fact_sentence_2's restatement of the same provision.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0f2cfa5e-fb62-4758-8fe0-1102a3d97086" target="ea73e6da-fbf4-4071-bc8b-386274d588a4">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the 30-day window for full refunds upon cancellation, which is explicitly confirmed and reinforced by fact_sentence_2’s restatement of the same rule.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0f2cfa5e-fb62-4758-8fe0-1102a3d97086" target="310584c0-76a7-4455-8d4e-410439b625ea">
      <data key="d3">The 30-day free look period enables immediate cancellation for a full refund, offering a safeguard before committing to ongoing premiums, thus supporting the eventual use of paid-up insurance should the policyholder decide against continuing contributions.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
