    <edge source="b2c34fb3-de6b-4d19-be40-3fdbc69743bb" target="c580619d-07d0-45d8-b554-365e608170c8">
      <data key="d3">Insurer limitations on contesting policies within the first two years support the policyholder’s right to cancel freely within the first month, reinforcing mutual fairness in early policy engagement.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b2c34fb3-de6b-4d19-be40-3fdbc69743bb" target="04d4a09c-1505-4f0e-9512-0c47ee4ef195">
      <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to contest the policy within the first two years implies that the policy was formally issued, consistent with the role of Guardian Family Protection Corp. as the issuer.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b2c34fb3-de6b-4d19-be40-3fdbc69743bb" target="df7e92d9-343b-4b72-82e8-0f1fcae86bd2">
      <data key="d3">The insurer’s ability to contest the policy within the first two years depends on the policy’s effective date, which was established by the signature date on February 1, 2024.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b2c34fb3-de6b-4d19-be40-3fdbc69743bb" target="5c3810ca-e6ef-4d1e-8db1-8029eb2277f1">
      <data key="d3">The first sentence sets a two-year window during which the insurer may challenge the policy, and the second clarifies that such challenges are permissible only if based on material misrepresentations in the original application.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b2c34fb3-de6b-4d19-be40-3fdbc69743bb" target="e3937ea4-ef37-43e5-bddb-1d3aabba2fb2">
      <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to contest the policy is restricted to the first two years after issuance, but only if the insured individual is still alive at the time of contestation.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a6d53b14-ef27-418e-8711-8c5a853b022b" target="b2c34fb3-de6b-4d19-be40-3fdbc69743bb">
